Our sg_split candidate "bugc": the v2 series MINUS its ->length clobber fix
(nb_splits overshoot fix + zero-nents copier guards only), to isolate bug C
(sg_dma_len aliasing ->length on !CONFIG_NEED_SG_DMA_LENGTH).

Against lib/sg_split.c at v7.1 (same file as the v2 series base 08d0d3466664).
Made from the former vendored tests/irl/linux/sg_split/sg_split_bugc.c; the
sg_split harness Makefile applies it (patch -o) to build that variant.

--- a/lib/sg_split.c
+++ b/lib/sg_split.c
@@ -1,8 +1,23 @@
